 "lines": [
  {
   "q": "Fifty emoji puzzles, from easy to legend, and they get harder every round. Keep score! First one: rain, plus a bow. What word is it?",
   "a": "Rainbow! Rain plus bow. You can only see one with the sun behind you."
  },
  {
   "q": "A sun, plus a flower.",
   "a": "Sunflower! Young sunflowers even turn to follow the sun across the sky."
  },
  {
   "q": "Snow, plus a man.",
   "a": "Snowman! Easy one. Every kid has built one, or tried to."
  },
  {
   "q": "Fire, plus a fly.",
   "a": "Firefly! And fun fact, fireflies aren't flies at all. They're beetles."
  },
  {
   "q": "A moon, plus a light bulb.",
   "a": "Moonlight! Which is really just sunlight bouncing off the moon. Nice and easy so far, right?"
  },
  {
   "q": "A key, plus a hole.",
   "a": "Keyhole! You're halfway through round one."
  },
  {
   "q": "A cat, plus a fish.",
   "a": "Catfish! Named for their long whiskers, just like a cat."
  },
  {
   "q": "Honey, plus the moon.",
   "a": "Honeymoon! The first sweet month of a marriage."
  },
  {
   "q": "Butter, plus milk.",
   "a": "Buttermilk! The liquid that's left after churning cream into butter."
  },
  {
   "q": "Last one of round one. A sailboat, plus a house. Careful with the order!",
   "a": "Houseboat! House comes first in the word, even though it's second on screen. Sneaky!"
  },
  {
   "q": "Round two: medium, and it gets harder now. A hand, plus a bag.",
   "a": "Handbag! Simple, but you'd be surprised how many say backpack."
  },
  {
   "q": "A dragon, plus a fly.",
   "a": "Dragonfly! They were flying around long before the dinosaurs."
  },
  {
   "q": "An egg, plus a plant.",
   "a": "Eggplant! Early ones were small and white, like eggs."
  },
  {
   "q": "A horse, plus a shoe.",
   "a": "Horseshoe! People hang them over doors for luck."
  },
  {
   "q": "Water, plus a melon. Bit of a giveaway!",
   "a": "Watermelon! It's about ninety two percent water. How's your score?"
  },
  {
   "q": "A lady, plus a bug.",
   "a": "Ladybug! Or ladybird, if you're in Britain."
  },
  {
   "q": "A book, plus a worm.",
   "a": "Bookworm! Someone who always has their nose in a book."
  },
  {
   "q": "An ear, plus a ring.",
   "a": "Earring! Easy, if you didn't overthink it."
  },
  {
   "q": "A door, plus a bell.",
   "a": "Doorbell! Ding dong, nine down in this round."
  },
  {
   "q": "Last one of round two. A tooth, plus a paintbrush.",
   "a": "Toothbrush! The brush on screen is a paintbrush, but the word wants a toothbrush. Round two done. Twenty out of twenty? Respect."
  },
  {
   "q": "Round three: hard. Only the sharp ones keep up from here. A cow, plus a boy.",
   "a": "Cowboy! Spanish cowboys, the vaqueros, came first."
  },
  {
   "q": "A light bulb, plus a house.",
   "a": "Lighthouse! The Lighthouse of Alexandria was one of the seven ancient wonders."
  },
  {
   "q": "A brain, plus a storm.",
   "a": "Brainstorm! Exactly what you're doing right now."
  },
  {
   "q": "A fish, plus a bowl.",
   "a": "Fishbowl! Halfway through round three."
  },
  {
   "q": "Rain, plus a tree.",
   "a": "Rainforest! The Amazon is the biggest one on Earth. If you're enjoying this, subscribe and turn on the bell!"
  },
  {
   "q": "Cheese, plus a cake.",
   "a": "Cheesecake! The ancient Greeks were already making a version of it."
  },
  {
   "q": "A tree, plus a house.",
   "a": "Treehouse! Every kid's dream hideout."
  },
  {
   "q": "A foot, plus a printer. Think about it.",
   "a": "Footprint! The most famous ones are still sitting on the moon."
  },
  {
   "q": "Sleep, plus walking.",
   "a": "Sleepwalk! It's much more common in kids than in adults."
  },
  {
   "q": "Last one of round three. The Earth, plus a worm.",
   "a": "Earthworm! Earthworms breathe through their skin. No lungs at all. Round three done. If you're above twenty five, you're doing great."
  },
  {
   "q": "Round four: very hard. Now it's not just one word any more. A snail, plus a letter.",
   "a": "Snail mail! A letter sent the slow way, by post."
  },
  {
   "q": "Eyes, plus candy.",
   "a": "Eye candy! Something nice to look at, but not much more."
  },
  {
   "q": "Fire, plus a house. It's a party!",
   "a": "Housewarming! A party to celebrate moving into a new home."
  },
  {
   "q": "A bed, plus a bug.",
   "a": "Bedbug! Good night, sleep tight, don't let the bedbugs bite."
  },
  {
   "q": "A bull, plus an eye.",
   "a": "Bullseye! The center of a target, and a perfect shot. Getting tough now!"
  },
  {
   "q": "A brain, plus a wave.",
   "a": "Brainwave! A sudden clever idea. Hopefully you're having lots."
  },
  {
   "q": "A horse, plus a strong arm.",
   "a": "Horsepower! James Watt came up with it to sell his steam engines."
  },
  {
   "q": "A ghost, plus someone writing.",
   "a": "Ghostwriter! Someone who writes a book that another person's name goes on."
  },
  {
   "q": "Money, plus a shark.",
   "a": "Loan shark! Someone who lends money at crazy prices. Stay away!"
  },
  {
   "q": "Last one of round four. A leg, plus a crash. It's a saying!",
   "a": "Break a leg! It means good luck, especially before a show. Round four done. Only legends left."
  },
  {
   "q": "Final round: legend level. These are sayings now. An elephant, plus a sofa.",
   "a": "The elephant in the room! A big problem everyone is ignoring."
  },
  {
   "q": "Rain, plus a cat, plus a dog.",
   "a": "Raining cats and dogs! Pouring with rain. Nobody really knows where it came from."
  },
  {
   "q": "A cake, plus walking.",
   "a": "Cakewalk! Something really easy. It started as a dance where the prize was a cake."
  },
  {
   "q": "Freezing cold, plus a turkey.",
   "a": "Cold turkey! Quitting something all at once."
  },
  {
   "q": "An apple, plus an eye.",
   "a": "The apple of my eye! Someone you love more than anyone. The phrase is over a thousand years old. You've got this."
  },
  {
   "q": "A cat, plus sleep.",
   "a": "Catnap! A short, light sleep, the way cats doze."
  },
  {
   "q": "Blue, plus a full moon.",
   "a": "Once in a blue moon! Very rarely. A real blue moon only comes about every two or three years."
  },
  {
   "q": "Three left, stay with me! Two birds, plus one stone.",
   "a": "Kill two birds with one stone! Getting two jobs done with one move."
  },
  {
   "q": "A hot pepper, plus a potato.",
   "a": "Hot potato! A topic nobody wants to touch."
  },
  {
   "q": "Final question. A cloud, plus the number nine.",
   "a": "On cloud nine! Feeling super happy."
  }
